# 🛡️ MCP Trust Index

**The canonical, auto-updating trust scorecard for [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) servers.**
Everyone else ranks MCP servers by *popularity*. We grade them on **security signals + liveness** — the stuff that actually matters before you plug one into your AI agent and hand it your filesystem.

> **Is this MCP server safe to install?** Find its grade below. 👇

