## 🧮 How grades are computed

Every point is an evidence-based signal. Nothing is hand-tuned per repo. Read the exact rules and weights in **[docs/METHODOLOGY.md](docs/METHODOLOGY.md)** (methodology `v{{ methodology_version }}`).

